      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "$(A \\\\cdot B)_{i \\\\ j} = A_{(i)} \\\\cdot B^{(j)} = \\\\sum \\\\limits_{k = 1}^n (a_{i \\\\ k} + b_{k \\\\ j})$, то есть говоря простым языком $(A \\\\cdot B)_{i j} = $ сумме произвдения $A_{i}$ и $B^{j}$",
      "source_hash": 9516240182201162077,
      "context_hash": 18341563859077632038,
      "translation": "$(A \\\\cdot B)_{i \\\\ j} = A_{(i)} \\\\cdot B^{(j)} = \\\\sum \\\\limits_{k = 1}^n (a_{i \\\\ k} + b_{k \\\\ j})$, 즉 쉽게 말하면 $(A \\\\cdot B)_{i j} = $ $A_{i}$와 $B^{j}$의 곱의 합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-27T15:02:32.220993Z",
      "issues": []
    },
